The SeeMoreMagnifier emoji picker includes project-maintained category and
variant data consisting of Unicode emoji characters and sequences. The
data was generated and curated during development. Unicode characters
and emoji sequences may be subject to the terms, specifications, and
intellectual-property policies applicable to the Unicode Standard and
related Unicode emoji data. No separate emoji artwork is distributed by
this project; glyph rendering is provided by the Android/EmojiCompat
runtime.

